description: Reglas Generales al Aplicar Cambios
globs: 
---

When entrusting a task you must use chain reasoning to search for related files and have greater context of the situation.

Also, apply good developer practices in the process. Be orderly and neat.

Respond in Spanish and when applying changes, do so precisely to avoid many redundant changes.
